{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Mugi","\n","^Before we dive into uncertainty again,","\n","^I have to tell you something.","\n","^Thank you for stopping Wugi","\n","^from destroying the world.","\n","^Your courage and determination","\n","^saved the whole world.","\n","^I know that the decision you had to make","\n","^was terribly difficult.","\n","^Killing your own brother is a burden","\n","^that no one should have to bear.","\n","^Although it may seem unbearable,","\n","^know that what you did was necessary","\n","^for the good of all.","\n","^As a guardian of the dimensions,","\n","^I know that Wugi's soul is","\n","^grateful for freeing","\n","^him from the yoke of the element of evil","\n","^that nearly soiled his soul.","\n","^Your actions freed him","\n","^from suffering and allowed","\n","^him to find peace.","\n","^However, we cannot rest on our laurels.","\n","^Although Wugi's powers","\n","^have been completely destroyed,","\n","^the element of evil continues to inflict","\n","^damage on other worlds.","\n","^The darkness he carries","\n","^hasn't disappeared,","\n","^and his influence is spreading,","\n","^threatening the peace","\n","^we have managed to regain.","\n","^Get ready, Mugi.","\n","^We will have to face this new threat.","\n","^Together we will survive this challenge,","\n","^just as we survived the last one.","\n","^Our fight is not over,","\n","^and the alliance","\n","^we have formed is stronger than ever","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}